WEBVTT

01:40.789 --> 01:45.680
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.180 --> 01:50.850
[Episode 35]

02:12.670 --> 02:13.600
What's going on?

02:13.870 --> 02:15.750
The main gate of the manor has been split open.

02:15.750 --> 02:16.950
This sword energy...

02:25.780 --> 02:27.800
Who dares to trespass into Divine Fire Villa?

02:27.800 --> 02:29.130
Do you have a death wish?

02:29.490 --> 02:30.720
Such audacity!

03:09.500 --> 03:11.310
What brings you here?

03:25.430 --> 03:26.430
Not talking, huh?

03:27.070 --> 03:29.329
Then you've brought this upon yourself.

03:30.310 --> 03:31.000
Kill him!

03:47.030 --> 03:48.230
Not bad skill.

04:18.709 --> 04:19.820
Unfortunately,

04:19.930 --> 04:21.390
your sword is inadequate.

04:21.540 --> 04:23.800
It can't withstand your swordsmanship.

04:32.490 --> 04:33.930
Any last words?

04:34.310 --> 04:35.190
Speak now.

04:49.390 --> 04:51.430
Die, you bastard!

04:56.780 --> 04:57.700
I'm sorry.

05:10.750 --> 05:11.870
This sword is...

05:14.360 --> 05:15.450
Wangquan?

05:15.600 --> 05:16.190
Not bad.

05:16.380 --> 05:18.990
This is indeed the Unparalleled Sword,

05:19.150 --> 05:20.800
the Wangquan Sword.

05:21.190 --> 05:23.030
Wind, Rain, Thunder, and Lightning.

05:23.030 --> 05:25.410
The four Guardians of Wangquan Manor

05:25.560 --> 05:27.090
have come to join the fun as well.

05:27.090 --> 05:29.220
[Lightning Sword Attendant]

05:27.830 --> 05:28.830
We wouldn't dare.

05:28.950 --> 05:30.720
Before the Unparalleled Sword,

05:30.460 --> 05:32.490
[Wind Sword Attendant]

05:31.270 --> 05:33.070
we are merely slaves to the sword.

05:33.070 --> 05:36.000
Therefore, the enemies of the Wangquan Sword...

05:33.350 --> 05:35.790
[Rain Sword Attendant]

05:36.270 --> 05:38.000
Are our enemies too.

05:36.390 --> 05:38.040
[Thunder Sword Attendant]

05:38.159 --> 05:42.060
[Wangquan]

05:51.830 --> 05:53.640
You think I'm afraid of...

05:57.380 --> 05:59.000
just you few?

05:59.600 --> 06:02.240
Of course not. You're not afraid.

06:05.230 --> 06:08.460
Back then, the old hero Dongfang was a prodigy.

06:08.600 --> 06:11.630
He single-handedly established the Divine Fire Villa,

06:11.630 --> 06:14.520
even rivaling the Wangquan Manor.

06:14.750 --> 06:16.210
Even our old family master

06:16.310 --> 06:17.800
held the old hero Dongfang

06:17.800 --> 06:19.680
in the highest regard.

06:20.680 --> 06:23.920
So even if Wind, Rain, Thunder, and Lightning all attack together,

06:23.920 --> 06:26.750
as the senior disciple of the old hero Dongfang,

06:27.160 --> 06:28.360
what is there to fear?

06:28.950 --> 06:29.810
Nothing at all.

06:30.120 --> 06:30.980
Nothing at all.

06:32.950 --> 06:34.240
Butler Fei.

06:35.270 --> 06:36.390
That's me.

06:37.290 --> 06:38.750
It seems today

06:39.120 --> 06:40.430
Wangquan Manor

06:40.909 --> 06:44.000
is insisting on interfering with the internal affairs of the Divine Fire Villa.

06:44.000 --> 06:45.390
Times have changed.

06:46.030 --> 06:48.830
Do you think I will show you any respect?

06:49.800 --> 06:51.560
Whether you show respect or not

06:51.560 --> 06:54.000
depends on how determined we are.

06:55.240 --> 06:56.600
The Wangquan family

06:56.680 --> 06:59.630
doesn't have talents as outstanding as you, Mr. Jin,

07:00.240 --> 07:02.170
but if it really comes to fighting,

07:02.390 --> 07:03.830
I'm afraid you will

07:03.830 --> 07:06.180
end up like old Dongfang, having to

07:06.430 --> 07:07.920
start from scratch again.

07:13.510 --> 07:14.640
Well, well.

07:15.390 --> 07:16.950
Not only the four Guardians,

07:16.950 --> 07:19.310
but even the young experts are all here.

07:19.800 --> 07:21.460
What exactly do you want to do?

07:24.120 --> 07:27.870
It seems you have some misunderstandings about us.

07:28.940 --> 07:30.060
We are

07:30.720 --> 07:34.070
just here for a marriage.

07:34.880 --> 07:37.350
[Divine Fire Villa]

07:42.390 --> 07:43.550
[Happiness]

07:51.200 --> 07:56.800
[Wangquan]

07:57.420 --> 07:59.080
When did the Divine Fire Villa

07:59.360 --> 08:01.870
ever arrange a marriage with Wangquan?

08:01.420 --> 08:05.130
[Calmness Before All]

08:02.240 --> 08:04.850
The bridal sedan chair is waiting outside.

08:05.520 --> 08:08.180
The entire Wangquan Manor is here to witness it.

08:08.790 --> 08:10.650
Do I look like I'm joking?

08:11.370 --> 08:13.510
As for whether the marriage was arranged or not,

08:13.510 --> 08:16.010
I think it's unnecessary.

08:16.080 --> 08:17.560
Our Master

08:18.120 --> 08:20.920
is just here to marry your cousin,

08:21.040 --> 08:22.560
Miss Churi Huaizhu,

08:22.560 --> 08:24.310
as a concubine.

08:43.750 --> 08:45.790
What a way to twist the facts!

08:45.890 --> 08:48.090
As expected of the Wangquan Manor!

08:48.720 --> 08:50.320
You're clearly relying on strength in numbers,

08:50.320 --> 08:52.180
bullying others with your power.

08:52.320 --> 08:53.580
Forgive my frankness,

08:54.240 --> 08:56.300
but even though you have more people,

08:56.940 --> 08:58.950
among those present today,

08:59.450 --> 09:01.450
there's not a single one

09:02.670 --> 09:04.640
who can take my life.

09:05.940 --> 09:08.740
Besides, the Wangquan Manor may have many people,

09:09.150 --> 09:11.550
but the Divine Fire Villa has people too.

09:13.650 --> 09:14.750
[Wangquan]

09:19.600 --> 09:20.670
You're right.

09:22.080 --> 09:22.880
You're right.

09:24.240 --> 09:27.040
Mr. Jin, you're indeed a top figure among the sects

09:27.240 --> 09:29.170
and one of the strongest fighters.

09:30.440 --> 09:32.430
And I have heard

09:32.750 --> 09:34.000
that you've received

09:34.000 --> 09:38.320
the Divine Fire secret technique,
personally passed down by the late hero Dongfang.

09:38.320 --> 09:41.120
Your skill must have improved by leaps and bounds.

09:41.700 --> 09:44.720
Of course, I'm impressed by the Dongfang family's

09:44.850 --> 09:47.330
secret technique for fast learning,

09:48.550 --> 09:52.270
but what I admire even more is

09:52.450 --> 09:55.420
the magnanimity of the old hero Dongfang.

09:55.930 --> 09:58.940
He generously gave the Divine Fire secret technique

09:59.080 --> 10:01.270
to you, Mr. Jin, who was neither his son

10:01.390 --> 10:04.150
nor his son-in-law.

10:04.360 --> 10:07.670
He didn't worry at all that after learning the true teachings,

10:07.670 --> 10:10.200
you might turn against his own daughter

10:10.390 --> 10:12.720
and take over Divine Fire Villa.

10:14.000 --> 10:16.860
This is an internal matter of the Divine Fire Villa.

10:17.080 --> 10:18.610
It's none of your business.

10:19.360 --> 10:20.270
Of course.

10:20.840 --> 10:21.920
Of course.

10:22.120 --> 10:24.950
Like old Mr. Dongfang,

10:25.120 --> 10:26.870
I trust you, Mr. Jin.

10:27.360 --> 10:28.320
However,

10:28.810 --> 10:32.840
people in this world often only look at the results.

10:35.040 --> 10:37.280
If the world mistakenly believes

10:37.790 --> 10:39.960
that you are an ungrateful and despicable person

10:39.960 --> 10:42.440
who killed his master to usurp his position,

10:42.740 --> 10:46.160
I'm afraid that after today's confrontation,

10:46.360 --> 10:50.790
it might be impossible for you to start from scratch.

10:50.880 --> 10:54.540
After all, one must make a name for oneself to establish a fortune.

10:54.670 --> 10:56.270
Cut the crap.

10:57.630 --> 10:59.130
What exactly do you want?

10:59.670 --> 11:01.060
Calm down, calm down.

11:01.370 --> 11:04.460
We are here to help you, of course.

11:05.240 --> 11:07.040
As long as you agree

11:07.530 --> 11:09.480
to your cousin's marriage,

11:09.770 --> 11:12.650
you'll become a relative of the Wangquan family.

11:13.360 --> 11:14.790
Since we'll be family,

11:16.030 --> 11:18.030
the Wangquan Manor won't object to

11:18.050 --> 11:20.290
whatever you say about the sudden death

11:20.670 --> 11:22.280
of the old hero Dongfang and the disappearance

11:22.280 --> 11:25.060
of his two daughters.

11:25.610 --> 11:26.890
By then,

11:27.150 --> 11:29.550
who wouldn't believe you?

11:30.270 --> 11:32.150
Who would dare not to believe you?

11:46.010 --> 11:51.790
[Calmness Before All]

11:53.150 --> 11:54.120
Huaizhu.

11:58.390 --> 12:01.630
I have fulfilled what I promised you, Young Master.

12:02.750 --> 12:04.840
So, what you promised...

12:37.150 --> 12:38.930
[Wangquan]

12:49.740 --> 12:50.470
[Wangquan]

12:54.940 --> 12:57.700
[Wangquan]

13:15.960 --> 13:18.510
Greetings, new family master.

13:18.290 --> 13:19.610
[Wangquan]

13:19.040 --> 13:21.760
Greetings, Master Wangquan.

13:27.770 --> 13:28.940
That day,

13:30.440 --> 13:32.810
the strongest swordsman I had ever met

13:33.150 --> 13:35.360
held the strongest sword in the world,

13:37.040 --> 13:39.300
but he had lost his sword spirit long ago.

14:11.980 --> 14:17.500
[On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

14:30.800 --> 14:32.050
Miss Huaizhu.

14:36.470 --> 14:39.130
I apologize for putting you through this.

14:40.560 --> 14:42.130
The wedding ceremony

14:42.230 --> 14:45.010
will be done according to the customs for a wife.

14:45.580 --> 14:46.910
After you enter the household,

14:46.910 --> 14:50.170
your status will be no different from that of a wife either.

14:52.070 --> 14:55.260
This Jin Renfeng is cunning and deceitful.

14:55.440 --> 14:58.730
Every moment we delay may cause unforeseen complications.

14:58.730 --> 15:01.790
The best course of action is to escort you away quickly.

15:03.440 --> 15:06.240
Mr. Fei, there's no need for further explanation.

15:08.320 --> 15:09.440
I understand.

15:10.610 --> 15:12.410
The plan to take me as a concubine

15:12.520 --> 15:16.490
is indeed the only solution to our current predicament.

15:18.040 --> 15:21.080
Moreover, what he said was true.

15:23.270 --> 15:25.390
Among those present, there was no one

15:27.780 --> 15:29.140
who could take his life.

15:37.840 --> 15:39.170
If only the Young Master

15:40.320 --> 15:42.680
were still the same as before.

15:54.580 --> 16:00.720
[On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

16:15.430 --> 16:17.400
♪ How can the wind stop? ♪

16:18.060 --> 16:20.520
♪ How can clouds stop for us? ♪

16:21.130 --> 16:24.850
♪ The vicissitudes of life never cease ♪

16:26.000 --> 16:30.380
♪ The time we spend together is too short and unreal ♪

16:31.310 --> 16:35.350
♪ You blur into a shadow near me ♪

16:33.360 --> 16:37.180
[Wangquan Manor]

16:36.440 --> 16:38.440
♪ We're fully committed ♪

16:38.980 --> 16:40.780
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

16:41.800 --> 16:45.530
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

16:46.380 --> 16:48.600
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

16:49.090 --> 16:51.470
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

16:52.500 --> 16:56.810
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

16:56.130 --> 16:58.900
Young Master Wangquan inheriting the position of family master

16:58.650 --> 17:03.090
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

16:59.910 --> 17:02.570
is a well-known event in the martial arts world.

17:03.730 --> 17:06.329
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

17:05.130 --> 17:08.210
As for him taking a concubine before marrying a wife,

17:06.750 --> 17:08.740
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

17:09.359 --> 17:12.359
at most it's only treated as casual gossip.

17:09.480 --> 17:11.440
♪ Time goes by ♪

17:11.980 --> 17:13.960
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

17:14.200 --> 17:16.349
I successfully transformed into Jin Renfeng's cousin

17:14.700 --> 17:18.130
♪ But our love remains still ♪

17:16.829 --> 17:19.030
who married into the Wangquan family.

17:19.660 --> 17:24.040
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

17:24.940 --> 17:27.500
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

17:28.210 --> 17:30.110
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

17:30.640 --> 17:32.310
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

17:33.050 --> 17:34.860
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

17:35.490 --> 17:39.080
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

18:00.890 --> 18:02.790
♪ We're fully committed ♪

18:03.430 --> 18:05.330
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

18:06.250 --> 18:10.140
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

18:06.790 --> 18:07.750
Huaizhu,

18:09.450 --> 18:12.350
I live in self-blame and regret every day.

18:10.600 --> 18:13.080
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

18:13.660 --> 18:15.830
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

18:14.030 --> 18:15.430
But seeing you before me,

18:15.800 --> 18:18.190
equally scarred and broken,

18:16.810 --> 18:21.130
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

18:19.310 --> 18:21.310
tears me apart even more.

18:23.100 --> 18:27.540
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

18:28.180 --> 18:30.600
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

18:31.200 --> 18:33.160
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

18:32.020 --> 18:33.900
Fate has been so cruel to us.

18:33.930 --> 18:35.880
♪ Time goes by ♪

18:35.200 --> 18:37.110
I don't know what else I can do.

18:36.640 --> 18:38.480
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

18:39.150 --> 18:42.530
♪ But our love remains still ♪

18:39.370 --> 18:40.820
But I only remember

18:43.090 --> 18:45.000
that I need to be by your side.

18:44.110 --> 18:48.490
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

18:49.230 --> 18:51.780
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

18:52.320 --> 18:54.330
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

18:54.790 --> 18:56.710
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

18:57.240 --> 18:59.160
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

18:59.750 --> 19:03.190
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

19:04.020 --> 19:06.580
[Unparalleled Sword]

19:26.420 --> 19:30.330
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

19:31.770 --> 19:34.000
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

19:34.670 --> 19:36.680
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

19:37.340 --> 19:39.010
♪ The past vanishes ♪

19:39.510 --> 19:41.360
♪ Like a dream and a whiff of smoke ♪

19:42.120 --> 19:46.010
♪ I hope to see you again in the next life, if there is one ♪

19:42.350 --> 19:43.200
Hongye,

19:44.500 --> 19:47.700
there's a selfish thing I've wanted to say for a long time.

19:50.090 --> 19:53.380
Your return is already the greatest blessing.

19:56.270 --> 19:57.400
For me,

19:58.150 --> 19:59.880
it surpasses everything else.

20:01.110 --> 20:07.220
[Unparalleled Sword]

20:17.310 --> 20:18.200
Wu.

20:24.640 --> 20:25.310
My Lady.

20:27.270 --> 20:28.800
Where is the family master?

20:29.140 --> 20:32.540
Master went to practice swordsmanship in the back mountain.

20:35.850 --> 20:41.770
[On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

20:52.200 --> 20:52.960
My Lady.

20:54.640 --> 20:57.680
You summoned me. What can I do for you?

20:58.610 --> 21:01.480
I have two matters I'd like your help with.

21:02.270 --> 21:03.790
I assume the first matter

21:04.440 --> 21:06.350
is about finding Miss Qinlan.

21:06.960 --> 21:08.440
Please rest assured, My Lady.

21:08.440 --> 21:10.370
Master has already sent out people

21:10.490 --> 21:13.490
to search everywhere for Miss Qinlan's whereabouts.

21:13.730 --> 21:15.530
There's no news yet.

21:16.550 --> 21:17.450
However, I have

21:17.510 --> 21:19.510
found a very secluded place

21:20.200 --> 21:21.350
and arranged for

21:21.400 --> 21:22.350
a niece of similar age

21:22.350 --> 21:24.590
to Miss Qinlan to live there.

21:25.400 --> 21:27.330
She stays indoors most of the time.

21:27.400 --> 21:29.960
Wind, Rain, Thunder, and Lightning

21:30.030 --> 21:33.830
and four teams of elite disciples
take turns guarding her in secret.

21:34.000 --> 21:36.420
I believe anyone capable of discovering this

21:36.420 --> 21:37.400
will think

21:37.500 --> 21:39.960
that Miss Qinlan is being protected inside.

21:40.400 --> 21:41.400
No one will

21:41.680 --> 21:44.110
search for Miss Qinlan's whereabouts anymore.

21:44.110 --> 21:44.750
Thank you.

21:46.200 --> 21:47.800
There's also another matter

21:48.000 --> 21:49.510
that I need to trouble you with.

21:49.510 --> 21:51.110
My Lady, there's no need for such formality.

21:51.110 --> 21:53.240
Please, just give your instructions.

21:54.720 --> 21:55.590
My father

21:56.510 --> 21:57.970
was killed by Jin Renfeng.

22:00.270 --> 22:02.730
I want to investigate this leech demon magic

22:03.440 --> 22:05.000
and find out its origins.

22:39.570 --> 22:41.180
It's already 9 P.M.

22:41.800 --> 22:44.740
Master, you should go back and rest early.

22:45.230 --> 22:47.270
This is golden thread bird's nest soup.

22:47.270 --> 22:50.000
Both you and the lady should nourish yourselves.

22:51.160 --> 22:54.200
Have you found Qinlan's whereabouts?

22:54.920 --> 22:55.680
Not yet.

22:56.310 --> 22:57.920
But please don't worry, Master.

22:57.920 --> 23:00.140
The lady's matters are of utmost importance.

23:00.140 --> 23:01.090
I understand.

23:01.240 --> 23:02.550
I will not slack off.

23:04.430 --> 23:07.320
I have already sent all the texts about

23:08.030 --> 23:09.880
the leech demon to the Lady.

23:10.530 --> 23:13.100
Master, won't you help her look into it?

23:18.830 --> 23:21.430
Have someone keep a close watch on Jin Renfeng.

23:21.440 --> 23:24.440
Inform me immediately of any news.

23:24.960 --> 23:25.920
I understand.

23:27.720 --> 23:28.780
It's getting late.

23:29.720 --> 23:31.780
After you drink the bird's nest soup,

23:32.110 --> 23:34.040
please return to your room to rest.

23:35.750 --> 23:36.960
Bring it to the lady.

23:37.160 --> 23:38.110
Master.

23:38.350 --> 23:39.160
Go.

23:56.190 --> 24:00.270
♪ A sudden storm fills the night ♪

23:59.860 --> 24:03.150
This is the bird's nest soup that Master ordered Steward Fei to bring.

24:00.810 --> 24:04.920
♪ 3,000 mayflies plunge into the dark river ♪

24:03.250 --> 24:04.850
He specifically instructed

24:04.960 --> 24:06.200
that your body is weak,

24:05.200 --> 24:06.570
♪ The relentless march of time ♪

24:06.270 --> 24:07.880
so you must nourish yourself.

24:07.190 --> 24:09.380
♪ Sweeping away the young you and me ♪

24:08.270 --> 24:09.350
It's so late.

24:09.830 --> 24:11.360
♪ I open my eyes ♪

24:10.220 --> 24:11.500
He's still up?

24:12.040 --> 24:14.360
♪ To the color of the night ♪

24:12.250 --> 24:15.450
He always practices his sword until late night.

24:15.270 --> 24:19.300
♪ With a wave of the sword, the mountains and rivers are ravaged ♪

24:16.600 --> 24:17.360
I see.

24:19.740 --> 24:23.870
♪ In an instant, I shelter myself in this fleeting life ♪

24:24.480 --> 24:26.670
♪ Countless times we traversed cliffs and abysses ♪

24:27.570 --> 24:29.130
♪ Side by side ♪

24:29.480 --> 24:33.630
♪ I remember every moment as clearly as daylight ♪

24:34.630 --> 24:36.510
♪ This heavy snowfall brought by fate ♪

24:36.840 --> 24:37.790
♪ This hopeless struggle ♪

24:38.180 --> 24:39.280
♪ Is it insoluble? ♪

24:39.440 --> 24:40.160
♪ Your warmth ♪

24:40.410 --> 24:43.440
♪ A trace alone breaks down my heart's defenses ♪

24:40.550 --> 24:43.870
[The Blood-Changing Technique of the Leech Clan]

24:44.100 --> 24:46.170
♪ Across countless withered bones and fallen leaves ♪

24:46.740 --> 24:48.610
♪ Watching a blood-red sunset together ♪

24:49.160 --> 24:50.430
♪ I thank the heavens ♪

24:51.100 --> 24:53.080
♪ I get to brave the blizzard with you in this life ♪

24:53.570 --> 24:55.650
♪ With the wind ♪

24:56.190 --> 24:57.930
♪ Comes countless farewells ♪

24:58.280 --> 25:00.320
♪ Whose lashes ♪

25:01.010 --> 25:02.740
♪ Are dyed red? ♪

25:03.520 --> 25:05.230
♪ Even if a single sword ♪

25:06.080 --> 25:07.560
♪ Turns love and hate to ashes ♪

25:07.910 --> 25:08.730
♪ You still come to me ♪

25:09.140 --> 25:12.080
♪ Fulfilling our destiny ♪

25:31.860 --> 25:35.890
♪ With a wave of the sword, the mountains and rivers are ravaged ♪

25:36.330 --> 25:40.460
♪ In an instant, I shelter myself in this fleeting life ♪

25:41.070 --> 25:43.260
♪ Countless times we traversed cliffs and abysses ♪

25:44.160 --> 25:45.720
♪ Side by side ♪

25:46.370 --> 25:49.700
♪ I remember every moment as clearly as daylight ♪

25:51.220 --> 25:53.100
♪ This heavy snowfall brought by fate ♪

25:53.430 --> 25:54.480
♪ This hopeless struggle ♪

25:54.980 --> 25:55.870
♪ Is it insoluble? ♪

25:56.030 --> 25:56.750
♪ Your warmth ♪

25:57.000 --> 26:00.030
♪ A trace alone breaks down my heart's defenses ♪

26:00.690 --> 26:02.760
♪ Across countless withered bones and fallen leaves ♪

26:03.330 --> 26:05.200
♪ Watching a blood-red sunset together ♪

26:05.750 --> 26:07.020
♪ I thank the heavens ♪

26:07.690 --> 26:09.670
♪ I get to brave the blizzard with you in this life ♪

26:10.590 --> 26:12.360
♪ With the wind ♪

26:13.180 --> 26:14.630
♪ Comes countless farewells ♪

26:15.300 --> 26:17.170
♪ Whose lashes ♪

26:18.030 --> 26:19.450
♪ Are dyed red? ♪

26:20.200 --> 26:22.050
♪ Even if a single sword ♪

26:21.630 --> 26:23.470
I have become your wife.

26:22.990 --> 26:24.250
♪ Turns love and hate to ashes ♪

26:24.460 --> 26:26.320
The bamboo pavilion changed to a courtyard.

26:24.640 --> 26:25.530
♪ You still come to me ♪

26:26.010 --> 26:28.920
♪ Fulfilling our destiny ♪

26:29.190 --> 26:30.280
You're here,

26:29.650 --> 26:31.500
♪ The rain falls ♪

26:31.040 --> 26:32.380
but your heart is not.

26:32.370 --> 26:33.730
♪ Tearing apart the long night ♪

26:34.440 --> 26:36.290
♪ Unraveling ♪

26:37.110 --> 26:38.730
♪ My suppressed tribulation ♪

26:38.520 --> 26:39.930
And my heart...

26:39.360 --> 26:41.250
♪ Flowers on the distant end bloom ♪

26:41.820 --> 26:43.350
Is not here either.

26:42.020 --> 26:43.490
♪ So near yet so far ♪

26:44.080 --> 26:47.700
♪ Get dead drunk again, with no care for the passing of time ♪

27:35.130 --> 27:37.090
[The Blood-Changing Technique of the Leech Clan]

27:35.550 --> 27:38.500
The blood-changing technique can steal the Dongfang Spiritual Blood,

27:38.500 --> 27:40.100
but it can't be regenerated.

27:40.580 --> 27:42.400
Even a tiny wound

27:42.600 --> 27:44.730
could potentially cost you your life.

27:45.290 --> 27:46.180
Jin Renfeng,

27:46.900 --> 27:48.330
this is your weakness.

27:52.700 --> 27:54.500
You're actually wearing armor.

27:58.300 --> 27:59.730
Cousin Huaizhu,

28:00.120 --> 28:03.480
why are you trying to assassinate me in secret?

28:05.900 --> 28:09.700
Instead of using the Divine Fire, you attempt to hurt me with a sword.

28:09.750 --> 28:10.870
It seems

28:11.800 --> 28:15.260
you already know the secret of the blood-changing technique.

28:15.350 --> 28:17.930
However, I will absolutely not give you the chance

28:17.930 --> 28:19.460
to harm me in the slightest.

28:54.360 --> 28:55.330
Father,

28:56.620 --> 28:58.880
I have finally avenged you.

29:00.510 --> 29:02.160
You're asking for death.

30:02.560 --> 30:03.690
No need to chase him.

30:05.510 --> 30:07.160
Even a small wound

30:08.060 --> 30:10.460
will make him lose everything he's gained.

30:12.640 --> 30:15.290
A fate worse than death.

30:58.440 --> 30:59.350
Aren't you

31:01.070 --> 31:03.270
the one who never cares about anything?

31:05.640 --> 31:07.370
Why did you secretly follow me?

31:10.980 --> 31:12.640
The Divine Fire won't harm me,

31:14.540 --> 31:16.890
but you took that hit for me.

31:17.300 --> 31:18.980
The internal injury it caused

31:21.930 --> 31:24.320
might destroy all your cultivation.

32:51.920 --> 32:53.220
Divine blood.

32:53.850 --> 32:55.380
My divine blood.

32:58.030 --> 33:00.210
Is there no way to save myself

33:00.350 --> 33:03.230
after losing the divine blood?

33:16.670 --> 33:19.600
Master, what's wrong?

33:20.060 --> 33:22.070
I've caught a bit of rubella.

33:22.590 --> 33:23.440
What is it?

33:24.520 --> 33:26.560
Master, recently I

33:26.590 --> 33:28.640
have discovered several spies from Wangquan Manor.

33:28.640 --> 33:29.640
-Enough.
-They…

33:30.920 --> 33:34.110
Don't bother me with these trivial matters in the future.

33:34.110 --> 33:34.910
But Master...

33:35.030 --> 33:36.020
Shut up.

33:39.310 --> 33:41.240
Have you finished making the pills

33:41.310 --> 33:42.770
I asked you to make?

33:42.920 --> 33:46.430
What you need are all life-extending pills.

33:46.560 --> 33:47.890
They are very precious.

33:47.920 --> 33:50.250
And the quantity you require is not small.

33:50.310 --> 33:52.550
Currently, the herbs available in the manor for making these pills

33:52.550 --> 33:53.680
are far from enough.

33:53.720 --> 33:54.590
So we...

33:55.440 --> 33:57.640
If there's not enough, then go buy more!

33:58.510 --> 34:00.770
Do I need to teach you such a simple thing?

34:00.920 --> 34:01.510
Yes.

34:03.800 --> 34:05.580
Master, you...

34:05.610 --> 34:08.850
I am feeling unwell.

34:09.710 --> 34:11.969
I need to go into seclusion to cultivate.

34:12.360 --> 34:14.280
Bring me

34:15.110 --> 34:17.000
all the pills I need.

34:17.360 --> 34:18.510
Did you hear me?

34:19.440 --> 34:20.230
Yes.

34:49.110 --> 34:50.550
Kill everyone!

34:50.630 --> 34:51.940
Kill!

34:52.190 --> 34:55.110
Because the Yiqi Alliance lost all its young elites,

34:55.110 --> 34:56.280
its power greatly diminished.

34:56.280 --> 34:58.440
The demons took advantage of this to invade.

34:58.440 --> 35:00.440
Hurry! Hurry! The village is under attack by a great demon!

35:00.440 --> 35:01.440
Everyone, follow me!

35:01.440 --> 35:02.070
Quickly!

35:03.130 --> 35:04.890
Overwhelming pleas for help

35:05.110 --> 35:07.400
flew to Wangquan Manor like snowflakes.

35:08.260 --> 35:10.080
Everyone is waiting to see

35:10.260 --> 35:12.930
how the Master of the Wangquan family, who has lost his sword spirit,

35:12.930 --> 35:15.600
will handle the current predicament.

35:24.840 --> 35:25.710
Kill!

35:25.710 --> 35:26.150
Kill!

35:26.150 --> 35:27.670
Kill!

35:28.440 --> 35:29.360
Over here!

35:29.070 --> 35:33.040
♪ The soul wandering in destiny ♪

35:29.440 --> 35:30.440
Stop right there!

35:30.840 --> 35:31.440
Don't run!

35:32.920 --> 35:34.120
Can humans and demons

35:34.460 --> 35:36.620
♪ It melts in your ♪

35:35.210 --> 35:37.290
not coexist peacefully?

35:37.400 --> 35:39.060
Survival of the fittest

35:37.750 --> 35:40.230
♪ Gentle gaze ♪

35:39.280 --> 35:40.940
is an ancient rule.

35:41.230 --> 35:45.620
If you want to blame someone, blame the Yiqi Alliance for becoming weak.

35:43.250 --> 35:47.420
♪ I trace your silhouette with my fingertips ♪

35:47.960 --> 35:49.110
I was wrong.

35:48.620 --> 35:50.530
♪ Reduced into ashes ♪

35:51.720 --> 35:54.460
♪ I'm still looking for you ♪

35:54.920 --> 35:56.970
We sacrificed everything

35:56.670 --> 35:58.590
♪ I used to be like the wind, searching ♪

35:58.370 --> 36:00.430
to prevent the Black Fox from entering this world.

35:58.810 --> 36:00.070
♪ Every nook and cranny ♪

36:00.640 --> 36:02.080
♪ And I was once like water, asking ♪

36:02.260 --> 36:03.230
♪ Every lake ♪

36:03.730 --> 36:05.370
♪ I swallow the growing thorns ♪

36:05.870 --> 36:07.730
♪ Lost in love's bitter toll ♪

36:07.290 --> 36:08.730
Was I wrong?

36:08.900 --> 36:10.740
♪ Yet I heard the pulse ♪

36:11.670 --> 36:14.760
♪ Letting everything rise from the void ♪

36:15.610 --> 36:18.350
♪ Making the sun and moon vanish from obsession ♪

36:16.330 --> 36:20.900
[Unparalleled Sword]

36:18.670 --> 36:20.440
As demons cause chaos everywhere,

36:19.330 --> 36:21.690
♪ And love drowns me ♪

36:21.230 --> 36:22.590
the entire Yiqi Alliance

36:22.590 --> 36:25.570
harbors more and more malicious energy towards Wangquan Manor.

36:22.780 --> 36:25.780
♪ In the fatal ecstasy ♪

36:26.000 --> 36:27.900
The elders of the Wangquan family

36:26.640 --> 36:29.260
♪ If I turn into a poisonous thorn apple ♪

36:27.920 --> 36:31.140
are also increasingly dissatisfied with Hongye.

36:30.120 --> 36:32.900
♪ Lurking in the dark ♪

36:33.520 --> 36:34.830
♪ If I can look ♪

36:35.640 --> 36:38.500
♪ Into your eyes, lingering ♪

36:39.330 --> 36:41.580
♪ And falling ♪

36:46.640 --> 36:48.300
The endless demons to be slain

36:49.070 --> 36:51.790
seem to mock Hongye's lone struggle,

36:53.070 --> 36:55.900
causing doubt to grow in his heart.

36:55.300 --> 36:59.100
♪ The soul wandering in destiny ♪

37:00.550 --> 37:02.860
♪ It melts in your ♪

37:03.630 --> 37:06.360
♪ Gentle gaze ♪

37:09.250 --> 37:13.310
♪ I trace your silhouette with my fingertips ♪

37:10.410 --> 37:12.310
He's given his all,

37:13.110 --> 37:16.290
but can he still not end the deadlock between humans and demons?

37:14.450 --> 37:16.290
♪ Reduced into ashes ♪

37:17.130 --> 37:20.380
♪ I'm still looking for you ♪

37:23.190 --> 37:25.180
♪ I was once like a stubborn flower ♪

37:25.490 --> 37:26.680
♪ Blooming in the desert ♪

37:27.150 --> 37:28.780
♪ The withered grass extinguished ♪

37:29.140 --> 37:29.900
♪ The flames of the eternal night ♪

37:30.540 --> 37:32.080
♪ The thorns all over the body illuminate ♪

37:32.610 --> 37:34.750
♪ Love's bitter toll ♪

37:35.720 --> 37:37.360
♪ Piercing through all the tenderness ♪

37:38.210 --> 37:41.270
♪ Letting everything rise from the void ♪

37:42.150 --> 37:44.980
♪ Making the sun and moon vanish from obsession ♪

37:45.020 --> 37:46.920
Why can't my sword intent

37:45.870 --> 37:48.300
♪ And love drowns me ♪

37:48.280 --> 37:49.840
be integrated?

37:49.310 --> 37:52.490
♪ In the fatal ecstasy ♪

37:50.200 --> 37:51.560
As a reckless youth,

37:52.190 --> 37:54.150
he believed nothing in the world was impossible.

37:53.180 --> 37:55.750
♪ If I turn into a poisonous thorn apple ♪

37:54.780 --> 37:56.170
As time went by,

37:56.660 --> 37:59.540
♪ Lurking in the dark ♪

37:56.790 --> 38:00.170
he finally realized that even the mightiest have their limits.

38:00.060 --> 38:01.540
♪ If I can look ♪

38:02.160 --> 38:05.040
♪ Into your eyes, lingering ♪

38:06.300 --> 38:09.450
♪ Letting everything rise from the void ♪

38:10.460 --> 38:13.130
♪ Making the sun and moon vanish from obsession ♪

38:14.110 --> 38:16.650
♪ And love drowns me ♪

38:17.460 --> 38:20.640
♪ In the fatal ecstasy ♪

38:21.350 --> 38:23.980
♪ If I turn into a poisonous thorn apple ♪

38:22.500 --> 38:25.190
Hongye and I have given everything,

38:24.780 --> 38:27.600
♪ Lurking in the dark ♪

38:25.480 --> 38:28.110
yet we've only delayed the Black Fox for a moment.

38:28.110 --> 38:29.400
♪ If I can look ♪

38:28.480 --> 38:30.210
If hatred isn't extinguished,

38:30.260 --> 38:32.370
the Eternal Night will never truly disperse.

38:30.270 --> 38:33.470
♪ Into your eyes, lingering ♪

38:33.600 --> 38:36.880
Perhaps this is the only way

38:34.690 --> 38:38.410
♪ And falling ♪

38:37.050 --> 38:38.780
to resolve everything.
